{"seq":2,"slug":"debates","title":"评价之辩","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/controversies-and-appraisal/debates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"interpretation-debates","title":"诠释之辩","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/interpretation-debates","wordCount":2017,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"applicability-debate","title":"适用性之辩","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/applicability-debate","wordCount":2004,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"评价之辩\">评价之辩</h1><p>本章呈现围绕《孙子兵法》的评价之辩。这部言简意赅的经典，引发了诸多不同的诠释；其在现代的适用性，也存在着不同的看法。两篇文档，分别呈现诠释之辩，以及适用性之辩，力求辩证而平衡。</p>\n"}